Metered billing (structure):
- src/nemesis-account.ts: device-key mint (JWT->proxy), $deviceKey store, LLM_PROXY_URL
- account dialog: 'Metered model key' row (mint/copy/rotate)
- cloud/nemesis-llm edge function + device_keys migration staged in the kit
  (OpenAI-compatible proxy: device key -> plan -> daily token budget -> DeepSeek
  -> usage_events; NOT yet deployed — needs owner OK on the prod project)

Deliverables generator:
- nemesis-deliverables skill: agent writes self-contained styled HTML slide
  decks/reports into Library/Exports + [Preview:](#preview/) link; brand-free,
  grounded-only. SOUL updated.
- Library renders .html deliverables live (sandboxed iframe) + Exports visible
  in the tree. E2E PROVED: agent built a 6-slide ACE-cough deck from chat.

Design pass (Emil Kowalski MIT skills, staged in kit design-skills/):
- flip curve -> 400ms strong ease-in-out; shake 350ms; deck-card hover +
  match-tile transitions scoped to GPU props with :active feedback
